  m_text: 'All standard position Malwick Brickworks employees have access to a variety
    of workplace amenities and services. It is important that they are used correctly
    and treated with respect.


    <size=40><u>Break Room</size></u>


    Standard
    position employees are entitled to two 15 minute unpaid breaks on a regular eight
    hour work day. Any employees caught overstaying their time on break will face
    strong repercussions. The break room is equipped with fridge, sink and '
