  m_text: 'dining table to eat. The room should not be rearranged in any capacity
    without permission. Food left in the fridge should be clearly named and eaten
    on the day it was brought in.


    <size=40><u>Lockers</size></u>


    Every
    Malwick employee is entitled to a locker to store their belongings. There are
    multiple locker rooms spread across the building, all of which are fitted with
    a four number combination lock. Your individual locker code will correspond with
    the calendar date of your first day at the company, using the day/month format.
    For example, if you were hired on April 6th, your locker code would be issued
